      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "What are the like terms in the expression $3h-v+7u+3t+5x?$",
      "worked_solution": "We write the terms of the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n(3h)+(-v)+(7u)+(3t)+(5x).\n$$\n\nNone of these terms have the same variable part. Consequently, there are no like terms in this expression.",
